-- title:
--   Public weights, bounded rejection, and chart calibration
-- statement:
--   These programs evaluate the background and paired-tensor weights, implement bounded rejection with an explicit fallback, and complete local charts by finite iteration, projection, and legalization. The random input is an explicit finite bit string. The definitions provide total algorithms, including behavior on malformed or insufficient encoded data.
-- source:
--   Companion Lean implementation for the fixed-family Gaussian affine transport theorem. The source modules and their SHA-256 hashes are recorded in the checked extraction manifest. This exact generated file has SHA-256 033424dc31e216d3ba0694b983f0e05bc95f78cbecbce320c65f18bf91557696. Source modules: Integration9_9_TM2NativeBackgroundMarked, Integration9_9_TM2NativeBackgroundTensor, Integration9_9_TM2NativeBackgroundLeg, Integration9_9_TM2NativeBackgroundPopulation, Integration9_9_TM2NativePairedTensor, Integration9_9_TM2NativeDistinctTuples, Integration9_9_TM2NativeTwoPoolAverage, Integration9_9_TM2NativeWeightEvaluation, Integration9_9_TM2NativeWeightTable, Integration9_9_TM2NativeWeightProgram, Integration9_9_TM2NativeCoreWeight, Integration9_9_TM2NativeRejection, Integration9_9_TM2NativePublicRejection, Integration9_9_TM2NativeCappedRejection, Integration9_9_TM2NativeChartCoordinates, Integration9_9_TM2NativeChartMetadata, Integration9_9_TM2NativeIteration, Integration9_9_TM2NativeChartProjection, Integration9_9_TM2NativeChartIteration, Integration9_9_TM2NativeChartLegalize, Integration9_9_TM2NativeFlagDraw, Integration9_9_TM2NativeFlagCompletion, Integration9_9_TM2NativeCharts, Integration9_9_TM2NativeRootGroupSingleton, Integration9_9_TM2NativeRootGroupReference. Alternate sparse native dependencies preserve the original non-import body bytes and all public types; this header-only packaging is recorded in sparse_live/manifest.json. Current source SHA256 786365ceb8ce48d2239a71359b58c67db142f774e5d5a9c3d5ab2f1fc5ae7aa4. Native10/11 split fallback keeps every original scope-closed data body unchanged and retains the canonical module names as import facades. Current source SHA256 786365ceb8ce48d2239a71359b58c67db142f774e5d5a9c3d5ab2f1fc5ae7aa4.

